{"id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-language.md","title":"Arithmetical Language","display":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-language","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-language"],"display":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-numeral]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-language — Arithmetical Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a> 的有限一阶语法；变量集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>，原始逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,+,\\times\">\\(S,+,\\times\\)</span>，元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2,2\">\\(1,2,2\\)</span>；等号为逻辑等号，没有非逻辑关系符号。项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq u\">\\(t\\doteq u\\)</span> 的记法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AV}\">\\(\\mathsf{AV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}\\)</span> 和避免捕获的同时替换采用本书通用一阶语法定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\\)</span> 是其中的经典展开式。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 在语言标签中不指公理集；数词接口来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a>。本书算术理论的共同句子域记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，共同指定矛盾记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_T=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\bot_T=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>；具体理论另行声明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq( \\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\times\\},\n\\{(S,1),(+,2),(\\times,2)\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t+u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\times u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\exists xA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\quad\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq(0=S0),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),\\quad\n\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq( \\{0\\},\\{S,+,\\times\\},\n\\{(S,1),(+,2),(\\times,2)\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v_i\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(0)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(St)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t+u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\times u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}})\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\to B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\exists xA)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\bar0&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq S\\bar n,\\quad\n\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\coloneqq(0=S0),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),\\quad\n\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigwedge_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\land A,\\\\\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\langle\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\n\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}(s\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq(\\bigvee_{\\mathrm{PA}}s)\\lor A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\\bot_T\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\quad\\bot_T\\coloneqq\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\quad(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 15–17；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n这里复用一般一阶语法，补充 PA 的具体签名、数词和自由变元；它并非整数最大公因子意义的“arithmetic”。上游原始逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\\)</span> 按经典定义先展开；所有递归沿有限语法树下降。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[89-df-first-order-formula]] 的有限一阶语法；变量集为 $\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}$，原始逻辑构造子为 $\\neg,\\lor,\\forall$。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 在语言标签中不指公理集；数词接口来自 [[89-df-numeral]]。本书算术理论的共同句子域记为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$，共同指定矛盾记为 $\\bot_T=\\bot_{\\mathrm{PA}}$；具体理论另行声明。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S,+,\\times","display":false},{"tex":"1,2,2","display":false},{"tex":"t=u","display":false},{"tex":"t\\doteq u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}